{"id":"penuel","name":"Penuel","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:penuel"],"types":[{"type":"place","from":"places atlas"}],"standing":"single-index","indexes":["nave"],"thin":false,"groups":["1. Also called PENIEL"],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Penuel","text":"Face of God, a place not far from Succoth, on the east of the Jordan and north of the river Jabbok. It is also called “Peniel.” Here Jacob wrestled (Gen. 32:24-32) “with a man” (“the angel”, Hos. 12:4. Jacob says of him, “I have seen God face to face”) “till the break of day.” A town was afterwards built there (Judg. 8:8; 1 Kings 12:25). The men of this place refused to succour Gideon and his little army when they were in pursuit of the Midianites (Judg. 8:1-21). On his return, Gideon slew the men of this city and razed its lofty watch-tower to the ground."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H6439","lemma":"פְּנוּאֵל","xlit":"Pᵉnûwʼêl","gloss":"Penuel or Peniel, a place East of Jordan","kjv":"Peniel, Penuel","count":7,"share":1},{"strong":"H582","lemma":"אֱנוֹשׁ","xlit":"ʼĕnôwsh","gloss":"a man in general","kjv":"another, thirsty, certain, chap; divers","count":3,"share":0.43}],"verses":["Gen.32.31","Judg.8.8","Judg.8.9","Judg.8.17","1Kgs.12.25","1Chr.4.4","1Chr.8.25"],"witnesses":["n","n","n","n","n","n","n"],"agreed":0,"broader":[],"narrower":[],"related":[{"id":"zalmunna","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.136,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"zebah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.136,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"tower","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.071,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"gideon","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.061,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"patriotism","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.022,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"ahikam","type":"lexical","strong":"H582","why":"both lead with אֱנוֹשׁ (H582)"},{"id":"baanah","type":"lexical","strong":"H582","why":"both lead with אֱנוֹשׁ (H582)"},{"id":"gedaliah","type":"lexical","strong":"H582","why":"both lead with אֱנוֹשׁ (H582)"},{"id":"ishmaelites","type":"lexical","strong":"H582","why":"both lead with אֱנוֹשׁ (H582)"},{"id":"nethaniah","type":"lexical","strong":"H582","why":"both lead with אֱנוֹשׁ (H582)"},{"id":"reconnoissance","type":"lexical","strong":"H582","why":"both lead with אֱנוֹשׁ (H582)"}],"works":[{"work":"antiquities","title":"Antiquities of the Jews","count":1,"chapters":[{"chapter":"AntVIII.8","count":1,"book":"Ant. 8","title":"How, Upon The Death Of Solomon The People Forsook His Son Rehoboam, And Ordained Jeroboam King Over The Ten Tribes."}]}]}
